WEBVTT

00:13:58.776 --> 00:14:01.253
But that has always been an aspiration.

00:14:01.277 --> 00:14:02.848
It is not a guarantee.

00:14:03.856 --> 00:14:06.021
The arc doesn't bend itself.

00:14:06.045 --> 00:14:09.720
It's not bent inevitably
by some mysterious force.

00:14:09.744 --> 00:14:11.416
The real truth,

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.831
which is scarier and also more liberating,

00:14:14.847 --> 00:14:16.062
is that we bend it.

00:14:16.943 --> 00:14:18.152
Thank you.

00:14:18.176 --> 00:14:20.793
(Applause)